{"server":"en","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_ex01_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_ex01","title":"True Grit","storyCode":"GT-EX-1","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_ex01_end.txt","sourceHash":"fde7abde12142182d2e7c6c887af60af3f613d79171a31c578e1f632958d3a04","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"...We should stuff him into a sack...\n...and hang him on the mast at dawn...\n...We should slit his throat...\n...and offer him to the ocean as a tribute to the raging hurricane..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"...that same dream again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"Who is it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"...Oh, it's just you. Hm, I can't even seem to remember your name."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"That doesn't matter. Just treat me like any normal Rhodes Island operator."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"You look like you're in pain."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just another nightmare."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"Dark fragments swirling in my consciousness, hidden beneath the shadows of that broken church..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"When I approach them, they turn into shackles and drag me down into the deep sea."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"But soon, there will be a way to escape your torment."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"Heh, is that so? That'd be great. But why should I trust you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"Heh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"Your aura... I'm quite familiar with it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"No, it's your smell. It's an intense, pungent smell... the smell of blood... 'their' smell. The smell of the deep sea."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"It's a familiar and abhorrent smell."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Is that so?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"Can you tell me your name?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Skadi."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"Interesting. So, why did you decide to show up here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"You're not supposed to be here without permission from Kal'tsit, unless you're not afraid of me ripping you to pieces."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"I am afraid. Just like everyone else. However, I'm used to fear."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"It's time to go. By the time I come back, things may have already moved forward. However, you can forget all about me, just like before."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"Where are you going?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"To where the secret is buried."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"A place far, far away from you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_143_ghost","aliases":["Specter"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["???","Skadi"]}]}
